---
---
<section class="services-section">
    <div class="services-container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
            <span class="section-label">Was ich anbiete</span>
            <h2>Leistungen</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="services-intro reveal d1">Als freiberuflicher Software-Architekt und Entwickler biete ich massgeschneiderte Lösungen für Ihr Projekt.</p>
        <div class="services-grid">
            <div class="service-card reveal d1">
                <div class="service-icon">
                    <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                        <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/>
                        <path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Software-Architektur</h3>
                <p>Konzeption skalierbarer Systemarchitekturen, fundierte technische Entscheidungen und Qualitätssicherung für komplexe Softwareprojekte.</p>
                <div class="service-tags">
                    <span>System Design</span>
                    <span>Cloud</span>
                    <span>APIs</span>
                    <span>QM-Software</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card reveal d2">
                <div class="service-icon">
                    <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                        <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/>
                        <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Full-Stack-Entwicklung</h3>
                <p>Umsetzung vollständiger Lösungen von Frontend bis Backend mit modernen Frameworks und hohen Code-Qualitätsstandards.</p>
                <div class="service-tags">
                    <span>TypeScript</span>
                    <span>React</span>
                    <span>Python</span>
                    <span>PHP</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card reveal d3">
                <div class="service-icon">
                    <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                        <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
                        <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
                        <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
                        <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Technische Beratung</h3>
                <p>Analyse von Geschäftsanforderungen, Prozessdokumentation und Brückenfunktion zwischen Fachabteilungen und Entwicklungsteams.</p>
                <div class="service-tags">
                    <span>Requirements</span>
                    <span>Stakeholder</span>
                    <span>Prozesse</span>
                    <span>Dokumentation</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card reveal d4">
                <div class="service-icon">
                    <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                        <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/>
                        <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Webanwendungen</h3>
                <p>Entwicklung performanter, skalierbarer und nutzerfreundlicher Webanwendungen für Unternehmen jeder Grösse.</p>
                <div class="service-tags">
                    <span>Astro</span>
                    <span>Node.js</span>
                    <span>Cloud</span>
                    <span>Responsive</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .services-section {
        padding: 5rem 2rem;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .section-label {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--accent-soft);
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
        color: var(--heading);
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1;
    }

    .services-intro {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 1.25rem auto 3rem;
        max-width: 560px;
    }

    .services-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .service-card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 1.25rem;
        padding: 2rem 2.25rem;
        transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    }

    .service-card:hover {
        border-color: var(--border-hover);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.10);
        transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .service-icon {
        color: var(--accent-soft);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .service-card h3 {
        color: var(--heading);
        margin: 0 0 0.7rem 0;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .service-card p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .service-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .service-tags span {
        background: var(--tag-bg);
        color: var(--tag-text);
        padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-size: 0.79rem;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .services-section {
            padding: 4rem 1rem;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 2.25rem;
        }

        .services-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
